ai "Game Manager"
about "Takes what the defense gives: the check-down, the throw-away, never the pick."
position QB
dials risk 0.15 patience 0.45 discipline 0.95 vision 0.55 aggression 0.2

rules:
  when before the throw and drop done and first read open -> throw to first read
  when before the throw and time over 2.6s and checkdown open -> check down
  when before the throw and pressure -> throw away
  when with the ball and pass play and past the line and enemy within 2.5 -> go down
  otherwise -> follow assignment
